guide forever/horde/orc-troll/02-the-barrens
title The Barrens
faction Horde
race Orc,Troll
levels 11-17
zone The Barrens
next forever/horde/02-the-barrens

# Route: the simulator's consensus Orc route (data/sim/export/consensus-horde-orc,
# visit 2, the Barrens 11.9-16.2). Trolls share it. Starts at the Crossroads,
# where the Durotar guide leaves you bound with the flight path; ends at the
# Crossroads, bound there, where the next guide picks up.
# Checked against the 2026-10-14 export, which runs Orgrimmar and Silverpine
# Forest first and reaches the Barrens at 14.3: its Barrens quests up to 17
# are this guide's, plus Ak'Zeloth / The Demon Seed (809, 924), which hang on
# the Orgrimmar stop the Durotar guide leaves out (see its header).
#
# Flow: Crossroads -> the plains around town (two short loops) -> Thun'grim
# and the Razormane camp -> Ratchet (flight path, bind) and the Southsea beach
# -> Crossroads -> Regthar, the Kolkar camps and the Forgotten Pools -> the
# Witchwing harpies -> the Sludge Fen research site -> Echeyakee -> hearth to
# Ratchet -> the Razormane camp again (Kreenig) -> Crossroads -> the Stagnant
# Oasis and the Raptor Grounds -> Lushwater Oasis -> Crossroads -> Mor'shan
# and the Sludge Fen buckets -> the Witchwing Slayers -> Crossroads.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Conscript of the Horde (840) is turned in at Far Watch Post at the end of
#   the Durotar guide, on the way in; Crossroads Conscription (842) is handed
#   to Sergra on arrival.
# - Stolen Booty (888) is done on the first Ratchet visit, in the pirate camp
#   you just cleared, instead of a second beach trip at 14.5.
# - Harpy Raiders (867) is done at about 14, after the Forgotten Pools next
#   door, so Harpy Lieutenants (875) needs only one trip to the Dry Hills (the
#   export goes there twice, at 15.6 and 16.1).
# - In Ratchet, Sputtervalve, Wrenix and Gazlowe up the hill come before
#   Wharfmaster Dizzywig on the dock: the dock is on the way to the beach.
# - Hearths: one bind in Ratchet (12.8) and one hearth there from Echeyakee's
#   lair (14.5); the export's other binds swap back and forth without a hearth
#   between them. The final bind is at the Crossroads (16.1). The Sepulcher
#   flight path and bind the export lists at 16.2 belong to Silverpine Forest
#   and are left to the guides that go there.
#
# Left out:
# - Chen's Empty Keg (819, 821): the keg lies at a random spot, and the chain
#   needs another Ratchet round trip plus a hunt for a 20% horn drop on the
#   Stormsnouts in the south (2,400 XP); a short grind at the Dry Hills covers
#   the level.
# - Apothecary Zamah (853) and Hamuul Runetotem (1489): the route never turns
#   them in. Mura Runetotem (3301) is carried to the Sepulcher in Silverpine.
#
# Class quests: Warriors finish Thun'grim Firegaze / Forged Steel (1502,
# 1503) by the Razormane camp. Shamans finish Call of Fire (2983, 1524-1527):
# Kranal Fiss, Telf Joolam across the river and the Burning Blade Cultists in
# Durotar for the Reagent Pouch. No class trainer on this route: train next in
# a capital.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Crossroads

step The Crossroads
  tip You arrive from Far Watch Post. Sergra stands by the inn; Thork and Darsok on the tower platform; Helbrim and Gazrog by the north gate; Tonga at the south gate.
  turnin 842                          -- Sergra Darkthorn
  accept 844
  accept 871                          -- Thork
  accept 5041
  accept 848                          -- Apothecary Helbrim
  accept 1492
  accept 869                          -- Gazrog
  accept 870                          -- Tonga Runetotem

step Plainstriders and raptors
  tip Plainstriders and Sunscale raptors roam the plains all around the Crossroads.
  collect 5087 quest 844.1 @53.0,23.7
  collect 5062 quest 869.1

step Sergra Darkthorn
  turnin 844
  accept 845

step Zhevra and raptors
  tip Zhevra Runners graze on the same plains; finish the raptor heads as you go.
  collect 5086 quest 845.1
  collect 5062 quest 869.1

step The Crossroads
  turnin 869                          -- Gazrog
  turnin 845                          -- Sergra Darkthorn
  accept 903
  accept 867                          -- Darsok Swiftdagger, on the tower platform: needs level 12

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Razormane camp and Ratchet

step Thun'grim Firegaze
  only Warrior
  tip Thun'grim camps beside the road east toward Ratchet.
  turnin 1502
  accept 1503

# Turn in a carried alternative here before starting the shared ritual;
# do not add a trip to a different trainer for an uncarried breadcrumb.

