step Kranal Fiss
  only Shaman
  tip Kranal Fiss stands on the ridge north of the Razormane camp, east of the Crossroads.
  turnin 2983
  accept 1524

step Telf Joolam
  only Shaman
  zone Durotar
  tip Telf waits on the Durotar bank of the Southfury River, east of the Razormane camp.
