step Dustwind Gulch cultists
  only Shaman
  zone Durotar
  tip Burning Blade Cultists hold Dustwind Gulch in northern Durotar, by Drygulch Ravine; they drop the Reagent Pouch.
  collect 6652 quest 1525.2

step Razormane camp
  zone The Barrens
  tip Water Seekers, Thornweavers and Hunters hold the camp east of the Crossroads. The supply crates sit at its eastern end. Warriors: the Stolen Iron Chest stands in the camp. Shamans: the quilboar drop the Fire Tar. Kill Savannah Prowlers you pass for their claws.
  kill 3267 quest 871.1
  kill 3268 quest 871.2
  kill 3265 quest 871.3
  collect 12708 quest 5041.1 @58.8,25.8
  collect 6534 quest 1503.1 only Warrior
  collect 5026 quest 1525.1 only Shaman
  collect 5096 quest 903.1 optional

step Telf Joolam
  only Shaman
  zone Durotar
  tip Telf makes Fire Sapta from the tar and pouch. Use it by the brazier next to him to reveal the Minor Manifestation of Fire, kill it for the Glowing Ember, then place the ember in the brazier.
  turnin 1525
  accept 1526
  collect 6655 quest 1526.1
  turnin 1526
  accept 1527

step Kranal Fiss
  only Shaman
  zone The Barrens
  turnin 1527 reward 5176 263412      -- Kranal Fiss: Searing Totem, your Fire Totem and the Totem of Charged Flames

step Thun'grim Firegaze
  only Warrior
  zone The Barrens
  turnin 1503

