  accept 97253                        -- Wrenix the Wretched
  accept 887                          -- Gazlowe
  turnin 1492                         -- Wharfmaster Dizzywig, on the dock

step Southsea beach
  tip The pirates camp along the beach south of Ratchet. The piles of complicated parts lie in and around their camp.
  kill 3381 quest 887.1
  kill 3382 quest 887.2
  collect 277331 quest 97253.1

