step Stolen Booty
  tip Back to the pirate camp: the boots are in the crate marked Drizzlik's Emporium at the camp's south end, the lens in the Fragile crate just east of it.
  collect 5076 quest 888.1 @62.6,49.6
  collect 5077 quest 888.2 @63.6,49.3

