  turnin 888

step Back to the Crossroads
  tip Walk back up the road to the Crossroads. Savannah Prowlers hunt along it and on the plains west of town: finish the claws before you hand them in.
  collect 5096 quest 903.1 optional
  turnin 903                          -- Sergra Darkthorn
  accept 881
  turnin 871                          -- Thork
  turnin 5041
  accept 872

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West and north

step Regthar Deathgate
  tip Regthar stands at the Kolkar watch post just west of the Crossroads.
  accept 855

step Kolkar camps and the Forgotten Pools
  tip The Kolkar camps spread north-west of Regthar; every Kolkar can drop Centaur Bracers. The Forgotten Pools lie in their middle, with Laden Mushrooms around the water. Savannah Prowlers roam the same plains.
  collect 5030 quest 855.1
  goto 45.1,22.5 "The Forgotten Pools"  -- Wade into the pools to explore them
  complete 870
  collect 5012 quest 848.1

step Regthar Deathgate
  turnin 855

step Witchwing harpies
  tip The harpies nest in the Dry Hills north-west of the Forgotten Pools; any of them can drop a talon.
  collect 5064 quest 867.1

step The Sludge Fen
  tip Head east to the Venture Co. research site west of the Sludge Fen. Use the Control Console, close the three valves around the drill, use the console again, then take the Console Key from Tinkerer Sniggles.
  turnin 894
  accept 900
  interact 61936 quest 900.2
  interact 61935 quest 900.3
  interact 4072 quest 900.1
  turnin 900
  accept 901
  collect 5089 quest 901.1
  turnin 901
  accept 902

step Echeyakee
  tip Echeyakee's lair lies south of the Sludge Fen, north-east of the Crossroads. Use the horn Sergra gave you there to call the white lion out. Then hearth to Ratchet.
  collect 5100 quest 881.1
  hearth "Ratchet"

step Sputtervalve
  turnin 902
  accept 3921

step The Disruption Ends
  tip On the way back to the Crossroads, the Razormane camp again: Geomancers and Defenders hold its eastern half; Kreenig Snarlsnout walks among them.
  kill 3269 quest 872.1
  kill 3266 quest 872.2
  collect 5063 quest 872.3

step The Crossroads
  turnin 872                          -- Thork
  turnin 867                          -- Darsok Swiftdagger
  accept 875
  turnin 881                          -- Sergra Darkthorn
  accept 905
  turnin 848                          -- Apothecary Helbrim
  turnin 870                          -- Tonga Runetotem
