# ---------------------------------------------------------------- South

step The Stagnant Oasis
  tip The oasis lies south-east of the Crossroads. Test the seeds at the bubbling fissure in the middle of the water.
  interact 3737 quest 877.1 @55.6,42.8

step Raptor Grounds
  tip The Raptor Grounds lie south-west of the oasis. Sunscale Scytheclaws drop the feathers you use on the three nests.
  interact 6906 quest 905.3 @52.5,46.6
  interact 6907 quest 905.1 @52.6,46.1
  interact 6908 quest 905.2 @52.0,46.5

step The Crossroads
