  turnin 880
  accept 3301

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North again

step Wenikee Boltbucket
  tip Follow the road north to the Mor'shan Rampart; Wenikee stands just south of it.
  turnin 3921
  accept 3922

step Nugget Slugs
  tip The Tool Buckets sit around the Venture Co. camp in the Sludge Fen, east of Wenikee.
  collect 11143 quest 3922.1

step Wenikee Boltbucket
  turnin 3922

step Witchwing Slayers
  tip The Slayers hold the western end of the Dry Hills, past the harpies you fought before; they drop the rings.
  collect 5065 quest 875.1
